WEBVTT

00:05:29.241 --> 00:05:31.744
and walk away with something learned.

00:05:33.329 --> 00:05:34.622
And back in my living room,

00:05:34.663 --> 00:05:36.624
we’re tackling the hardest part:

00:05:36.916 --> 00:05:40.461
to decide where are we giving together.

00:05:41.462 --> 00:05:44.799
So we'll learn and then we'll vote,

00:05:44.799 --> 00:05:47.551
and we'll discuss,
and we'll change our minds.

00:05:47.593 --> 00:05:49.804
And then we'll change our minds again.

00:05:50.554 --> 00:05:52.473
But beyond fail,

00:05:52.473 --> 00:05:55.434
we always come to an agreement at the end

00:05:55.476 --> 00:05:57.686
because we come with an open heart

00:05:57.686 --> 00:05:59.063
and an open mind.

00:05:59.605 --> 00:06:01.190
Now giving circle,